Package: aqstandards
Title: Air Quality Standards
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Brayden", "Nilson", , "nilson.brayden@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    This package provides functions to calculate various air quality standards such as the Canadian Ambient Air Quality Standards (CAAQS) and the British Columbia Air Quality Objectives (BCAQO). 
    The functions take in concentration data and return attainment status for each pollutant and averaging period. 
    The package is designed to be used by air quality professionals and researchers who need to calculate attainment status for air quality monitoring data.
